#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:127
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:98
#: 0325bf7aa1d042d782e906cfab81bf70 705ab1a40de14d7d8c79f4809c38e8df
#: 8c9c149c7cec4c77a06a0ed9743e18db ff1112e3337c40d4bd275e4f72736b9e
msgid ""
"For normal operation, the Disabled output function sets the output value of "
"the channel to 0, ie no PWM pulses being sent. The exception to this is when"
" a MAVLink override of the channel or a mission servo set is used. So in "
"some ways \"disabled\" could be called \"mission-controlled\"."
msgstr ""
"正常工作时，「已禁用」输出功能会将通道输出值设为0，即不发送 PWM 脉冲。例外情况是通过 MAVLink "
"覆盖通道或任务中的舵机设置时。因此在某种意义上，「已禁用」也可称为「任务控制」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:103
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:132
#: 9ef7b6d6e9c24e0896372f11f9fd29ed ae4db7dad3e746fca061e3edc50485fc
#: dbe85ddeb2a44735802b80095be750b7 ddafb2f6340245bd9c11c7ea3963da8f
msgid ""
"When you perform an auto mission you can ask for a servo to be set to a "
"value as part of that mission. In that case you should set the "
"SERVOn_FUNCTION for that channel to Disabled, so that the value doesn't get "
"changed by another output function immediately after the mission sets the "
"value."
msgstr ""
"当执行自动任务时，您可以要求舵机在任务的某个阶段被设置为特定值。在这种情况下，应将该通道的 SERVOn_FUNCTION 设为 "
"Disabled，以防任务设置值后立即被其他输出功能覆盖。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:112
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:141
#: 1b0446b8a80b440d89ae20264bbe49e6 8612693fe5e44932a9fefd47680e0b22
#: e00fd907725247578bf74e5a18f6d7a8 e60a07a82eaa4fb281acbe344dfba549
msgid ""
"Setting a channel to RCPassThru means it will output the value that is "
"coming into the board from the corresponding input channel. For example, if "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` is 1 (meaning RCPassThru) then "
"channel 5 output will always be equal to channel 5 input."
msgstr ""
"将通道设为 RCPassThru 意味着它将输出来自对应输入通道的值。例如，若 "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` 为1（即 RCPassThru），则通道5的输出将始终等于通道5的输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:117
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:146
#: 152eb6326e6e4a368acb6504f3e55f4a 436f929ae9a04bf0917c7b6b0f5b989f
#: b2b3f4ed65e94474bab43d4da549c419 e2191646e04d4d538f12d1504cd5204f
msgid ""
"The servo output will exactly match the RC input source's PWM value. "
"RCx_TRIM/_MIN/_MAX and SERVOx_TRIM/_MIN/_MAX has no affect in this mode."
msgstr ""
"舵机输出将完全匹配 RC 输入源的 PWM 值。在此模式下，RCx_TRIM/_MIN/_MAX 和 SERVOx_TRIM/_MIN/_MAX "
"不起作用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:120
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:149
#: 58ffdbb50a6145a28c21f1129a2219aa 7118025e41a84bdebbd74c59430505ca
#: 8639e2a814614c76ad96b2ec7ccebc79 8dd1a5ddef2644c5aa8746aa4412afd1
msgid "RCPassThru1 to RCPassThru16"
msgstr "RCPassThru1 到 RCPassThru16"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:122
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:151
#: 6d53774988d74fd8b7dfae94b870c583 6d9fe67c6eba408e8b7208fa873ea628
#: 880658a2141e404db8ba44d6e5dca40d fb45adfc50ff45f6a4a225601bc2aecb
msgid ""
"This operates the same as RCPassThru explained above. However, instead of "
"the ``SERVOx`` output being controlled by the ``RCx`` input, any RC input "
"can be assigned to control this output. For example RCPassThru 1 (51) would "
"assign RC Channel 1 input to control the output. So, for output 1, assigning"
" 51 to the :ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION<SERVO1_FUNCTION>` is identical to assigning"
"  the value of 1 passing RC Channel 1 to the output."
msgstr ""
"其工作原理与上述 RCPassThru 相同。但不同之处在于，``SERVOx`` 输出不由 ``RCx`` 输入控制，而是可以将任意 RC "
"输入指定给该输出。例如，RCPassThru 1（51）会将 RC 通道1的输入分配给控制该输出。因此，对于输出1，将51赋给 "
":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION<SERVO1_FUNCTION>` 与赋值1（将 RC 通道1直通到输出）效果相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:124
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:153
#: 0e7b7504da0e421d86f55d56ea5affd2 7bafe76cee2b4a2da0976f69b45066ea
#: c7773c3d41084256bfbd84e0e88e4c08 fcb27264c1514c24a9cba47fcd7d9553
msgid ""
"normally passthru outputs will hold their last valid value during an RC "
"failsafe. By setting the :ref:`SERVO_RC_FS_MSK<SERVO_RC_FS_MSK>`, selected "
"passthru outputs can be set as if their input channel went to neutral. This "
"is helpful for outputs controlling servo gimbals, or other manually "
"controlled functions."
msgstr ""
"通常，直通输出在 RC 失控保护期间会保持最后的有效值。通过设置 "
":ref:`SERVO_RC_FS_MSK<SERVO_RC_FS_MSK>`，可使选定的直通输出表现为其输入通道回到中立位。这对控制云台舵机或其他手动控制功能的输出很有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:157
#: 14479b3b3efc4a07bb057d749630cc10 2549d5e25cc142ec9291131f66498d89
#: edcaa7be01624fe4b7c0d7c7b702cccf
msgid "RCIN1Scaled to RCIN16Scaled"
msgstr "RCIN1Scaled 到 RCIN16Scaled"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:159
#: 49f7d21ad6274d6ea7a891391988970c d19da88d07bd485592262d935c1d798d
#: ff370ddc690e44f48f912303edfcc046
msgid ""
"This operates similar to RCPassThru1 to RCPassThru16 above. However, instead"
" of exactly passing the received PWM to the output, its is scaled.The RC "
"input's dead-zone(DZ) is also obeyed."
msgstr ""
"其工作原理与上述 RCPassThru1 到 RCPassThru16 类似。但不同之处在于，它不是将接收到的 PWM "
"精确直通到输出，而是进行缩放。同时也遵守 RC 输入的死区（DZ）设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:161
#: 2f87258c1e884e688f63b966687fa38b 30fb036474ba4b6780fd81f416411cfb
#: 46409cb0db01419590b30a6c76ef3489
msgid ""
"The upper PWM range from the input trim value to its maximum input is "
"translated to its corresponding output's trim to maximum parameter values "
"range, and similarly for the ranges below the input's trim value as shown "
"below:"
msgstr "从输入微调值到最大输入值的 PWM 上限范围，将被映射到对应输出的微调值至最大值参数范围；输入微调值以下的范围同理，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:166
#: 6372caa8b3194490b87ed4c43c2e3870 8b37c15aaaf248eba09b71ea841ece4b
#: da91365aa4224cdf9b35d5446471fb3c
msgid ""
"the SERVOx_MIN/MAX values can be larger than what Mission Planner allows in "
"some presentations. Use the CONFIG/Full Parameter Tree view to set parametes"
" beyong their normal \"safe\" ranges."
msgstr ""
"SERVOx_MIN/MAX 的值在某些视图中可能超出 Mission Planner 允许的范围。请使用 CONFIG/Full Parameter "
"Tree 视图，以在正常「安全」范围之外设置参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:168
#: 47b4cba467d443dc93d7db892b3b7ad0 8d4075a3c1804732b03710e6c5c5d251
#: d5c4b1ff722c49e590096632a56eaaf9
msgid ""
"normally scaled passthru outputs will hold their last valid value during an "
"RC failsafe. By setting the :ref:`SERVO_RC_FS_MSK<SERVO_RC_FS_MSK>`, "
"selected passthru outputs can be set as if their input channel went to "
"neutral. This is helpful for outputs controlling servo gimbals, or other "
"manually controlled functions."
msgstr ""
"通常，缩放直通输出在 RC 失控保护期间会保持最后的有效值。通过设置 "
":ref:`SERVO_RC_FS_MSK<SERVO_RC_FS_MSK>`，可使选定的直通输出表现为其输入通道回到中立位。这对控制云台舵机或其他手动控制功能的输出很有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:173
#: 11a3c9f055bd4127b0cc8f422b4d6828 48a1470d83e24ea5972b1b78aa660644
#: fffbac243a314a67b1bfce395936e6f4
msgid "PLANE FUNCTIONS (Also applies to QuadPlanes)"
msgstr "固定翼功能（同样适用于垂直起降固定翼）"

