#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:430
#: 964f2a5bc6c44eaaad01cc2a75595da6
msgid ""
"In Plane, these outputs are for differential thrust in twin engine aircraft "
"and the amount of yaw affecting the base throttle value is determined by "
":ref:`RUDD_DT_GAIN<RUDD_DT_GAIN>`. Also, in Plane's vectored Tailsitters, "
"these are the motor outputs."
msgstr ""
"在 Plane 中，这些输出用于双发动机飞机的差动推力，偏航对基础油门值的影响量由 :ref:`RUDD_DT_GAIN<RUDD_DT_GAIN>` "
"决定。此外，在 Plane 的矢量尾座式飞机中，这些是电机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:334
#: bffa326ec7744d96a73d909e651e8b68
msgid ""
"In Rover, these outputs are for control of the steering motors in "
":ref:`Skid-Steering Rovers <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration-skid>`."
msgstr ""
"在 Rover 中，这些输出用于控制 :ref:`差速转向 Rover <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration-"
"skid>` 中的转向电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:379
#: 0853c1f169a042e9acbf6e9e5b78f42c
msgid ""
"This output is used to control the Main Sail in Rover based Sailboats. See "
":ref:`Sailing Vehicle Setup<sailboat-hardware>` setup for more information."
msgstr "此输出用于控制基于 Rover 的帆船的主帆。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`帆船车辆设置<sailboat-hardware>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:567
